---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { latestEdition, longDateLabel } from '../lib/site';

const edition = latestEdition();
const dateLabel = longDateLabel(edition.date);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About CurrentWire"
  description="CurrentWire is a morning news front for the stories worth following, and the questions worth carrying into the day."
  lastUpdatedIst={edition.last_updated_ist}
  dateLabel={dateLabel}
  kicker="About"
  timezone={edition.timezone}
>
  <article class="about-card">
    <h1>About CurrentWire</h1>
    <p>
      CurrentWire is a morning news front. It keeps a short ladder of stories worth following, then files the rest by section so the useful questions can travel into the day.
    </p>
    <p>
      The front page leads with Top Picks: a middle stack for the stronger and fresher stories, and a right rail for the rest of that ladder. Every section hub uses the same ladder.
    </p>
    <p>
      Editions are dated in India Standard Time (Asia/Calcutta). The bar at the top of a page shows when that edition was last updated. A story page also shows when the piece was first filed and when it was last updated.
    </p>
    <h2>Credit</h2>
    <p>Built and maintained by Ojaas Hampiholi.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://ojaashampiholi.github.io/the-cosmic-notebook/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Cosmic Notebook</a>
      is a separate project: clear, curious notes on the forces, worlds, and ideas that shape our universe.
    </p>
    <p>More from Ojaas (tech and fiction) coming here.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
